Z||000001||Oreif||09-03-2001||10:31 PM||||Check the codes. It's probably related to the EGR. Glowing manifolds is usually a vacuum leak, a cracked EGR tube, or Bad EGR.<BR>When manifolds glow it is usually due to a high lean condition. High lean condition might also set an O2 sensor code too.||||reg||1
